Derived portions include the model intake and viewport patterns
(`src/lib/modelFiles.ts`, `src/lib/modelLoad.ts`, `src/lib/modelAxis.ts`,
`src/lib/threeGeometry.ts`, `src/lib/viewport3d.ts`), the UV stretch and texel
density math (`src/lib/unwrap/metrics.ts`, `src/lib/unwrap/density.ts`), the UV
coverage rasterizer (`src/lib/unwrap/raster.ts`), the CLI host split
(`cli/`, `src/cli/`), the Tauri CLI bridge (`src-tauri/src/cli.rs`), and the
git-count versioning scripts (`scripts/build-version.mjs`,
`scripts/write-tauri-version.mjs`).

The unwrap pipeline itself is an UltiUnwrapper implementation so each stage
can be inspected independently.
